{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-psa-149-1","title":"Psalms 149:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":149,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":149,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 The prophet exhorts to praise God for his love to the church; 5 and for that power which he has given to the church.</p>\n<p>Praise ye the Lord. Heb. Hallelujah. 148:1 Sing. 33:3; 96:1; 98:1; 144:9; Isa 42:10; Re 5:9 in the congregation. 22:22,25; 68:26; 89:5; 111:1; 116:18; Heb 2:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-149-2","title":"Psalms 149:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":149,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":149,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>rejoice. 100:1-3; 135:3,4; De 7:6,7; 12:7; 1Sa 12:22; Job 35:10; Isa 54:5 let the. Isa 52:7; 62:11,12; Joe 2:23; Zec 9:9; Mt 21:5; 25:34; Lu 19:27,38 Joh 19:15,19-22; Php 3:3; Re 19:6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-149-3","title":"Psalms 149:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":149,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":149,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>in the dance. or, with the pipe. 150:4; *marg: Ex 15:20; Jud 11:34; 2Sa 6:16; Jer 31:13 with the timbrel. 33:2; 81:2; 137:2-4; 150:3-5; 1Ch 15:28,29; 16:42; 25:6; 2Ch 29:25 Ezr 3:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-149-4","title":"Psalms 149:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":149,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":149,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>taketh pleasure. 22:8; 35:27; 117:2; 147:11; Pr 11:20; Isa 62:4,5; Jer 32:41 Zep 3:17 beautify. 90:17; 132:16; Isa 61:1-3,10; Heb 12:10; 1Pe 3:4; 5:5; Re 7:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-149-5","title":"Psalms 149:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":149,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":149,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>the saints. 23:1; 118:15; 145:10; Ro 5:2; 1Pe 1:8 sing. 42:8; 63:5,6; 92:2; Job 35:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-149-6","title":"Psalms 149:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":149,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":149,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>the high. 96:4; Ne 9:5; Da 4:37; Lu 2:14; Re 19:6 mouth. Heb. throat. 115:7; 145:3-5 and a two-edged. Heb 4:12; Re 1:16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-149-7","title":"Psalms 149:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":149,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":149,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>137:8,9; Nu 31:2,3; Jud 5:23; 1Sa 15:2,3,18-23; Zec 9:13-16 Zec 14:17-19; Re 19:11-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-149-8","title":"Psalms 149:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":149,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":149,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>Jos 10:23,24; 12:7; Jud 1:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-psa-149-9","title":"Psalms 149:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PSA","chapterStart":149,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":149,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>to execute. 137:8; De 7:1,2; 32:42,43; Isa 14:22,23; Re 17:14-16 this honour. 148:14; 1Co 6:2,3; Re 3:21</p>"}]}